nt-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">home interiors</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">, </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">party planning</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">, and </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">jewelry selection</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">. By combining the power of </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">FastAPI</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">&nbsp;with </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">Gemini 1.5 Flash Pro</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">, the system intelligently processes user inputs‚Äîbudgets, preferences, and even images‚Äîto generate accurate and context-aware suggestions from multiple trusted platforms like </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">Amazon</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">, </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">Flipkart</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">, </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">IKEA</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">, </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">Swiggy</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">, </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">Zomato</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">, &nbsp;</span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">OYO and more</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">.From backend architecture to AI integration and a responsive frontend, PocketSmart AI has been built with a focus on </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">efficiency</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">, </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">scalability</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">, and </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">user-centric design</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;;font-style:normal">. The FastAPI backend ensures modular, secure routing and robust session handling, while the Jinja2-powered frontend offers an intuitive and clean interface for users to interact with the system in real time.</span></p><p style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;line-height:1.0;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">Each module‚Äîfrom registration to recommendations‚Äîis designed to simplify decision-making and enhance the shopping or planning experience through automation and personalization. Whether it‚Äôs finding the right wall art within budget or organizing a last-minute party, PocketSmart AI acts as a </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">smart digital assistant</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">, saving time and effort while optimizing outcomes.With its seamless fusion of generative AI and web technologies, </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">PocketSmart AI</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">stands as a practical example of how </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;">AI can enhance everyday decision-making</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family